{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9d5c517e-3003-46f8-9530-45d725bee8d5",
    "name": "Auctions — full bidding lifecycle",
    "description": "A single auction run start to finish against POST /bid.\n\nBefore each run:\n\n1. `npm run db:up && npm run db:migrate`\n2. `npm start`\n3. `npm run postman:env` — seeds a fresh auction and rewrites the environment\n4. Import both files, select the \"auctions — local\" environment, Run.\n\nEvery request asserts its own outcome, so a green run is a passing acceptance suite rather than a set of requests that merely returned something. The collection asserts exact sequence numbers and prices, so re-run step 3 before every run — bidding twice into the same auction will not reproduce them.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 — Precondition",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01. The auction is fresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"outcome is REJECTED_BELOW_INCREMENT\", () => pm.expect(body.outcome).to.eql(\"REJECTED_BELOW_INCREMENT\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"current top is 0\", () => pm.expect(body.currentTopCents).to.eql(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bid",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"auction_id\": \"{{auctionId}}\",\n  \"user_id\": \"{{bob}}\",\n  \"amount\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "A 1-paisa bid on an untouched auction: refused for being under the increment, and reporting a current top of zero. If this fails, the environment is stale — re-run `npm run postman:env`.\n\nIt carries a throwaway {{$guid}} key deliberately. With no key the fingerprint fallback would replay the previous run's answer and report a fresh auction even on a dirty one — the guard would be defeated by the mechanism it sits beside."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
